  "id": "tax.us.2025.rule.schedule-d-line16",
  "notes": "Part III line 16 = line 7 + line 15, signed. v4 still requires the eight sale-count symbols, in the same order as v3, so a recorded v83 return names the same missing counts. A box 7 yes no longer blocks the line by itself. Each sale family publishes a loss check. The check is 0 when every sale on a box 7 statement is a gain or zero, and it blocks when box 7 is checked and column (h) on that statement is below zero. An unanswered box 7 still blocks and asks the same question. This return does not compute the disallowed loss.",
